":{"cul:203-moneywort-or-herb-twopence":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Moneywort, Or Herb Twopence","headword":"Moneywort, Or Herb Twopence","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"Venus owns it. Moneywort is singularly good to stay all fluxes in man or woman, whether they be lasks, bloody-fluxes, bleeding inwardly or outwardly, or the weakness of the stomach that is given to casting. It is very good also for the ulcers or excoriations of the lungs, or other inward parts. It is exceedingly good for all wounds, either fresh or green, to heal them speedily, and for all old ulcers that are of spreading natures. For all which purposes the juice of the herb, or the powder drank in water wherein hot steel hath been often quenched; or the decoction of the green herb in wine or water drank, or used to the outward place, to wash or bathe them, or to have tents dipped therein and put into them, are effectual.","spans":[{"start":96,"end":101,"concept_id":"diarrhea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":103,"end":116,"concept_id":"dysentery","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":118,"end":126,"concept_id":"hemorrhage","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":157,"end":180,"concept_id":"dyspepsia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":198,"end":205,"concept_id":"nausea_vomiting","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":236,"end":271,"concept_id":"tuberculosis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":327,"end":333,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":397,"end":403,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"images":[]}